{"id":"vod_sn_38506","vodId":"38506","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"灰羽联盟","name_cn":"灰羽联盟","date":"2002-01-01","year":"2002","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1f0f2c4f64dfe4edd702157c6f622918.jpg"},"summary":"在这个灰暗宁静的城市里，住着一群生长着灰色羽翼的孩子们，有一个名为“灰羽联盟”的机构在暗中庇护着他们不受到外界侵扰，就这样，沉默的孩子们每一天都过着平静的日子。他们是谁？来自哪里？背后的翅膀有何含义？孩子们一概不知，他们诞生在此，成长在此，没有亲人，没有故乡，甚至没有回忆，他们唯一知道的事情是，只要永远的生活在这栗城里，他们就会是安全的。　　这一天，孩子们迎来了他们新的成员落下（广桥凉 配音），作为前辈，空（矢岛晶子 配音）、光（折笠富美子 配音）和砾（野田顺子 配音）怀着喜悦的心情接受了她的到来。而这仅仅是故事的开始，慢慢的，当这些善良单纯的孩子们知道了一切的真相，她们还能够展开灰色的翅膀离开栗城，飞向天空吗？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:02:08","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/N2h9B7YXYX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/WKd6xDND4X1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/tt8AeFGk5e1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/uRn6YjJzUz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ThDPmxeC6s1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/b23hAWh4D61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/kiPshez2SJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/9dmfSbvNkp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/jvTuaj3Hce1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/GdaEgLEpMR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/PLcScGK4Ln1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/waWtX36cnL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Am1Mvg9VX51/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:57.988Z"}